   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen best&#xe5;r av 4 aktiviteter:  seminarium f&#xf6;r prickskyttar   f&#xf6;rhandlingskurs   kriterier f&#xf6;r rekrytering, mentala f&#xf6;rberedelser och debriefing identifiering av utbildnings- och utrustningsbehov f&#xf6;r dykare</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a continuation of cooperation between the Special Forces in Latvia and Sweden. It aims to further support and strengthen the Latvian Specail Force, by providing training in sharp-shooting, methods and critera for recruitment, negotiation skills, mental preparation and debriefing skills.</narrative>
